cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below. A manuscript describing the tool is in preparation; this file will be updated with its reference when it is available."
title: "WormTransgeneBuilder: an online app for comprehensive C. elegans transgene design"
type: software
version: 2.0.0
date-released: 2026-10-04
license: GPL-3.0-only
repository-code: "https://github.com/christianfj/WormTransgeneBuilderv2"
url: "https://www.wormbuilder.org/transgenebuilder/"
abstract: >-
  Full gene synthesis is increasingly affordable and cost-effective relative to standard cloning.
  WormTransgeneBuilder is a one-stop online app for designing C. elegans transgenes. It offers codon
  adaptation algorithms for high expression, reduced germline silencing, or the stochastic use of
  frequent endogenous codons; minimization of ribosomal binding site energy; removal of piRNA
  homology; removal of restriction sites; and the addition of C. elegans-specific standard bioparts
  such as promoters, introns, tags and UTRs, with export to GenBank.
